  "summary": "Malicious code in @servicetitan/contentful (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun/releases, then uses it to execute a heavily obfuscated 727KB payload file (math_init.js). The payload is a Bun-compiled bundle containing eval, Function constructor, and child_process calls with an extensive base64-encoded string table. The package depends on @servicetitan/react-hooks. The package name impersonates a legitimate ServiceTitan Contentful integration library.",
